{"resourceIdentifier":"4130","resourceName":"GIRESUN LANDFILL GAS (LFG) PROJECT","description":"The project, Giresun Solid Waste Management Facility and Electricity Generation Facility (4.353 MWm / 4.242 MWe) is in Giresun Province, Görele District, Çavuşlu neighbourhood, and owned and operated by Biotrend.\r\nGiresun LFG plant has been granted the generation license from EMRA on 24/12/2020. As per the generation license, the annual expected generation is 31,815,000 kWh/year. The first unit was commissioned on 02/04/2021. Accordingly, project activity start date is 02/04/2021.\r\nThis project adopts the renewal crediting period of 7 years. The expected average annual emission reductions are 52,207 (tCO2e).","location":{"latitude":41.030811,"longitude":39.075620},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2023-04-17","endExclusive":"2023-05-18","endInclusive":"2023-05-17"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"4130"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Görele"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Multiple Proponents"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"64635"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Waste handling and disposal"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"ACM0001"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Earthood Services Limited"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"04/07/2025"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 02/04/2021 - 01/04/2028"}]}]}],"documentGroups":[{"code":"VCS_PIPELINE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Pipeline Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_V